The assert statement is based on the comment "@@@ array contains the added value after the operation". In this case, we don't have the original value of '_size' before the 'Add' operation, but we can use the return value of the 'Add' operation as the 'RET'. The 'RET' in this case should refer to '_size' after the 'Add' operation, which is incremented by 1. Therefore, the assert statement would be:

```cs
Debug.Assert(OLD(_size) + 1 == RET);
